B.Zn=new A.aP(B.H,B.a9,3,"S and L: Ring Fingers","Add your ring fingers: S (left) and L (right).","sss lfl jll llk jsj sl lsl kl ls sss dl lll lsl fss sl sl sl ks fs ll ls sss lf jl llk ssk lsl fl lll sds dll llf",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","sl","Left ring: S \xb7 Right ring: L","Ring fingers are weaker \u2014 go slowly and focus on accuracy, not speed.")
B.YR=new A.aP(B.H,B.a9,4,"A and ; : Little Fingers","Add your little fingers: A (left) and semicolon (right).","faa ;; kak j;j ;; ;;f ;; l;; ;s ;a; f;f ;;; k; ;; aa aak ;l fa ;a ;;; ;a aaa aa ;; d;; a;a l; a;a ;;; ;;; afa ;a;",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","a;","Left little: A \xb7 Right little: ;","Your home row is now complete: A S D F (left) and J K L ; (right).")
B.YH=new A.aP(B.H,B.a9,5,"G and H: Index Stretch","Stretch your index fingers sideways to G (left) and H (right).","hah gg fh agg hg gh hh gg ghg fg kh gg hhh hj hh hh kh kg agg ggg khk hhh ah kgk ghg hgh dgg dhh gg gjg hha ghg",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","gh","Left index: G \xb7 Right index: H","Stretch the index finger sideways, then return it to F or J straight away.")
B.YP=new A.aP(B.H,B.a9,6,"Home Row Words","Real words made only from home row letters.","ask dad sad lad gas has had fall hall glad flag half flash slash salad flask shall lass dash gash hash lash all ash add fads lads jags",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","","All eight fingers on the home row","Keep all fingers resting on A S D F and J K L ; and return to them after every key.")
B.YM=new A.aP(B.H,B.a9,7,"Home Row Review","Short phrases to lock in the home row.","a sad lad; a glad dad; ask dad; all fall; has a flask; had a salad; half a flag; a glass; a dash; a flask; a lass has a gas flask; dad had a salad; ask a lad;",90,0,"Stage 1 \xb7 Home Row","","All eight fingers on the home row","Do not look down. If you lose your place, find the bumps on F and J again.")
B.Z4=new A.aP(B.H,B.a9,8,"E and I: Reach Up","Reach up with your middle fingers to E (left) and I (right).","ee e;e iii jij ;e; ij iei fii iii eie eee iii eel ee; fi iii ee eel jij side like life lie die kid ill sell feel seed fled dies hide isle alike self kiss skill shed heal lead idea",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","ei","Left middle: E \xb7 Right middle: I","Reach up from D and K, then return to the home row. The other fingers stay in place.")
