B.Z8=new A.aP(B.H,B.a9,10,"T and Y: Index Stretch Up","Stretch your index fingers to T (left) and Y (right).","yt tt ttj tkt yyy yty lt yy yt yys ftt ete tt tyt ttt yl yyy ti ty yyl that they tall study dusty stay yet tray style turtle tail fifty guilty hasty yard duty tidy lately daily safety thirsty",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","ty","Left index: T \xb7 Right index: Y","Use the same index finger that types R or U \u2014 just stretch it one key further.")
B.Zj=new A.aP(B.H,B.a9,11,"W and O: Ring Fingers Up","Reach up with your ring fingers to W (left) and O (right).","oo ewe eoe hww oo ww owo ww wow joo sw owo ow ww awa jw wwj www lwl wo word wood low slow those wolf follow show would hello wall wide owl glow owe row work world worth throw tow",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","wo","Left ring: W \xb7 Right ring: O","Ring fingers need practice. Slow and accurate is better than fast and wrong.")
B.Z2=new A.aP(B.H,B.a9,12,"Q and P: Little Fingers Up","Reach up with your little fingers to Q (left) and P (right).","qqq qtq sps ppp qp ppp pph pgp qq qqq pk pp kp qsq pq qqq qfq iq ppk qp quiet quote puppy paper pour quite queue equal pilot spoil power pure quirk upper happy please pull page quilt",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","qp","Left little: Q \xb7 Right little: P","These are the farthest top-row keys. Keep your wrist steady and move only your finger.")
B.Y6=new A.aP(B.H,B.a9,13,"Top Row Words",u.L,"quiet write your tree pretty wire quote type require water flower tired paper surely rough she wrote her poetry; the poet felt tired; a quiet lad kept the key",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","","All eight fingers","Say each word in your head while you type it. It helps your fingers remember.")
B.Y8=new A.aP(B.H,B.a9,14,"Top Row Review","More top row and home row practice.","a quiet lad kept the key; she poured the water; his paper fell; the pilot wrote her letter; where were those flowers; you should rest; sure; hold the rope; she tried to skip the trail; ",90,0,"Stage 2 \xb7 Top Row","","All eight fingers","Try to keep a steady rhythm: the same speed for every key.")
